      "body": "Closing: the recipes' 31-37% KV use and 0 preemptions don't need the headroom, and the field was renamed on main. If a Terminal-Bench run logs preemptions, set `extra_vllm_engine_args={\"watermark\": 0.03}` with that run as the evidence.",
